OL,3,APolice appeal to help find heavily
OL,4,Apregnant woman
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have appealed for help in their
OL,7,Fsearch for a missing woman who is
OL,8,Fheavily pregnant.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Police said Charlie Ryan
OL,11,Fwas reported missing on Friday morning,
OL,12,Fhaving last been seen in the Groby Road
OL,13,Farea of Leicester near to New Parks Way
OL,14,Froundabout.
OL,16,FThe force said the 31-year-old is
OL,17,Fwhite, 165cm (5ft 5in), with bright
OL,18,Fblonde hair. She was last seen wearing
OL,19,Fa black jacket, grey jumper, black
OL,20,Fleggings and black shoes.
